TO RESTART THE FRONTEND SERVICE, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose restart frontend  

TO START THE DOCKER COMPOSE SERVICES, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose up -d          

TO SHUTDOWN THE DOCKER COMPOSE SERVICES, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose down   

TO BUILD CONTAINER IMAGES, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose up --build  

TO VIEW THE LOGS OF THE SERVICES, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose logs -f

TO VIEW THE STATUS OF THE SERVICES, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose ps

TO SEED THE DATABASE, YOU CAN USE THE FOLLOWING COMMAND:

docker compose exec backend php artisan migrate:fresh --seed                                              

